Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 17:42:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Native Gemini, AIStudio and Antigravity routes


Consolidated from the following original patches (file custody by final owner):

- original #02: 0002 native-gemini-aistudio
- original #03: 0003 native-antigravity
- original #04: 0004 gemini-history-tools
- original #13: Validate native Gemini streams before recording account
- original #14: Reject malformed native Gemini candidates before account
- original #15: Guard native Gemini actions and transformed response success
- original #16: Scope Gemini server-part history to authenticated callers
- original #17: Align native Gemini authentication aliases across existing
- original #21: Preserve native Gemini errors on router failures
- original #23: Accept upstream DONE without invalidating native SSE
- original #24: Validate native Gemini candidate content before account
- original #25: Preserve nested provider model IDs through both Gemini API
- original #27: Keep Gemini model identifiers inside their authenticated URL
- original #28: Keep native TTS deadlines and account health through body
- original #29: Expose native Gemini error responses with the established
- original #31: Reject unrecognized unprojected native replies while
- original #32: Keep opaque native transport frames separate from reply
- original #33: Keep per-request Gemini response continuity in the Zed
- original #36: Strip internal native credentials and preserve unprojected
- original #37: Provide real crypto to native route fixtures and preserve raw
- original #38: Scope Gemini turn signatures to authenticated conversations
- original #41: Wire AIStudio credential validation and live model discovery
- original #54: Restore mapped tool names on native Gemini and frame the
- original #55: Frame unterminated native events and replay scopes from
- original #56: Terminate the restored final native SSE event before closing
- original #60: Traverse Gemini type constraints over schema children only
